{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20261I5hO4RW5t1795185032.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>港超榜首大戰，理文3-1擊敗高力北區。</p><p></p><p>半場0-0，黃衫理文靠角球攻勢開紀錄，杜素諾夫接應頂入，57分鐘領先。到78分鐘，憑前場壓逼，巴科爾射入，為理文拉開兩球優勢。</p><p></p><p>北區的格蘭特，82分鐘頂入追近，但尾段再輸多球，巴科爾射入十二碼，為理文鎖定贏3-1，開季後聯賽七勝一負，壓過北區上榜首。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T15:24:07.264061+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T14:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T08:17:35.987892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T15:17:23.683653+00:00","content_hash":"8464a3b3df598b06b1122628dc3454f82aeaeb1b66569c9eeb4875e424eba1bf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T15:24:07.264061+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}